{comment: Verse 1}
[G]River of stars, carry me [D]home
[Em]Past every field and the [C]roads I have known
[G]Moon in the reeds and the [D]wind in the pine
[Em]Sing me to sleep on the [C]river of [G]time

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Row, row, [G]follow the [D]light
[Em]One small boat in the [C]wide open [D]night
[C]River of stars, [G]carry me [D]home
[Em]Every wave [C]singing the [G]way I have [D]known
